# App Store Isaac CANNOT be debugged with lldb on stock macOS.
# Both `run` and `process attach` fail:
#   "process exited with status -1"  OR  "Not allowed to attach to process"
# This is normal for signed App Store apps (SIP / debug entitlement).
#
# Use capture instead:
#   bash isaac_learn_capture.sh before
#   # play, pick up 1 item
#   bash isaac_learn_capture.sh after
#
# Correct binary path (for reference only):
#   /Applications/The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth.app/Wrapper/The Binding of Isaac Rebirth.app/The Binding of Isaac Rebirth
#
# Do NOT use the outer .app launcher or a truncated path.
